  "title": "Avoid passing NULL pointer into hashing function in packet-gsm_sms.c",
  "description": "In function sm_fragment_params_hash() in file epan/dissectors/packet-gsm_sms.c, the pointer key and key->addr_info should be checked before passed into wmem_str_hash() in case of passing NULL into the hash function.\n\nIt is similar to the function sm_fragment_hash() in the same file.\n\nSimilar bug and fix: https://code.wireshark.org/review/gitweb?p=wireshark.git;a=commit;h=1d8680d07f92352c4ff95083fe578e8f263bac6d",
