        },
        {
          "id": 435571655,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "I think the static analysis checker is reporting a false positive.\n\nHowever, the code is also wrong in the areas I have indicated.\n\nI will have to look at some of my captures to see if I can repro the issue that caused me to add the checks for NULL (although maybe I simply copied that from the GSM dissector to the ieee1905 dissector.)",
          "author": {
